scripturesstudio-assets (1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch packaging from a single bundled scripturesstudio-assets deb
    to one binary package per psalm chapter, plus a common package for
    shared background assets and a meta package depending on all of
    them (preserving the scripturesstudio-assets dependency name).

